1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Engineering leaders manage dozens of fragmented tools across GitHub, Datadog, Jira, and AWS Cost Explorer. Critical pull request bottlenecks and sudden cloud spend spikes go unnoticed until Monday morning. This is Mercury.

2
00:00:25,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Mercury transforms Amazon Alexa Plus and Fire TV into an executive war room. Powered by the open Model Context Protocol over Streamable HTTP, leaders query deployment frequency and PR review SLAs with a single voice prompt.

3
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:40,000
When staging workloads surge over the weekend, Mercury's AWS Cost Radar detects the anomaly, projects the month-end burn rate, and pinpoints the exact root cause in seconds.

4
00:01:40,000 --> 00:02:15,000
When a flaky release causes change failures, Mercury stages a safe production rollback. The CTO authorizes the action with a voice token, executing immediate remediation hands-free.

5
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:35,000
Mercury gives engineering leaders instant clarity and decisive control. Built for Amazon Alexa Plus, Fire TV, and AWS.
